## 2. Key Problems Identified

| # | Problem | Details |
|---|---------|---------|
| 1 | **Loose root components** | 14 files dumped directly in `components/` — layouts, navbars, modals, route guards mixed together |
| 2 | **Mislabeled `shared/` folder** | Contains 10 instructor course-editor components — not shared at all |
| 3 | **Duplicate files** | `components/shared/` and `pages/Courses/components/` have 9 overlapping files (BasicInfoTab, CurriculumTab, etc.). Only `pages/Courses/components/` versions are actually imported; `components/shared/` copies are **dead code** |
| 4 | **Empty `components/instructor/`** | Unused directory |
| 5 | **Flat pages directory** | Student, instructor, and admin pages mixed in one `pages/` tree with no domain separation |
| 6 | **God hook files** | [useAcademy.ts](file:///c:/Users/Administrator/Videos/alikohub-v2/domains/academy/lms/src/hooks/useAcademy.ts) (871 lines) mixes student & instructor hooks; [useAuth.ts](file:///c:/Users/Administrator/Videos/alikohub-v2/domains/academy/lms/src/hooks/useAuth.ts) (323 lines) mixes auth & admin hooks |
| 7 | **God service files** | [academyService.ts](file:///c:/Users/Administrator/Videos/alikohub-v2/domains/academy/lms/src/services/academyService.ts) (14KB) serves all domains |
| 8 | **Missing context organization** | `context/` has only [ThemeContext.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Administrator/Videos/alikohub-v2/domains/academy/lms/src/context/ThemeContext.tsx) — fine for now but should live in a clear location |

---

